    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a magical journey with a cute llama lost in the vast mountains of the Bolivian Altiplano, facing many challenges as you build your llama sanctuary to protect your family. Be ready, the fate of Llamalandia is in your hands!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/2c6c525f39dce1c56399213025055ddd.poster.avif?t=1754724897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/2c6c525f39dce1c56399213025055ddd.webm?t=1754724897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover breathtaking landscapes, explore mysterious temples, and different ecosystems filled with unique animals and secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Gather valuable resources as you go. Every expedition offers a new opportunity to discover the unexpected in the vast and enchanting world of Llamalandia!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/0b37caac10015b3bdb00d5e1534dfe3e.poster.avif?t=1754724897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/0b37caac10015b3bdb00d5e1534dfe3e.webm?t=1754724897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your llama sanctuary\u00a0using the resources you gather on your adventures, and watch it grow and thrive as you progress through the game. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build homes, farms, and other structures, each with a unique function to help you protect and care for your llama family. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/97a1ba88b2e693b246820817154259cd.poster.avif?t=1754724897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/97a1ba88b2e693b246820817154259cd.webm?t=1754724897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Venture into the world of Llamalandia to recruit new llamas to your family, and create a unique bond and relationship with each llama you encounter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise the baby llamas to take them on your adventures, watch them grow, and build the biggest and happiest llama community in the world!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/f6982a0aa60ce833ec703c414e40dc76.poster.avif?t=1754724897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/f6982a0aa60ce833ec703c414e40dc76.webm?t=1754724897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet alpacas, guanacos, armadillos, and other cute animals from the Bolivian Altiplano. Invite them to your sanctuary, but be prepared:\u00a0 because convincing them to join you will be quite a challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, interact, and make new friends on your journey!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embark on a magical journey with a cute llama lost in the vast mountains of the Bolivian Altiplano, facing many challenges as you build your llama sanctuary to protect your family. Be ready, the fate of Llamalandia is in your hands!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/2c6c525f39dce1c56399213025055ddd.poster.avif?t=1754724897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/2c6c525f39dce1c56399213025055ddd.webm?t=1754724897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover breathtaking landscapes, explore mysterious temples, and different ecosystems filled with unique animals and secrets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Gather valuable resources as you go. Every expedition offers a new opportunity to discover the unexpected in the vast and enchanting world of Llamalandia!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/0b37caac10015b3bdb00d5e1534dfe3e.poster.avif?t=1754724897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/0b37caac10015b3bdb00d5e1534dfe3e.webm?t=1754724897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your llama sanctuary\u00a0using the resources you gather on your adventures, and watch it grow and thrive as you progress through the game. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build homes, farms, and other structures, each with a unique function to help you protect and care for your llama family. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/97a1ba88b2e693b246820817154259cd.poster.avif?t=1754724897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/97a1ba88b2e693b246820817154259cd.webm?t=1754724897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Venture into the world of Llamalandia to recruit new llamas to your family, and create a unique bond and relationship with each llama you encounter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise the baby llamas to take them on your adventures, watch them grow, and build the biggest and happiest llama community in the world!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/f6982a0aa60ce833ec703c414e40dc76.poster.avif?t=1754724897\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2470990/extras/f6982a0aa60ce833ec703c414e40dc76.webm?t=1754724897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet alpacas, guanacos, armadillos, and other cute animals from the Bolivian Altiplano. Invite them to your sanctuary, but be prepared:\u00a0 because convincing them to join you will be quite a challenge.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, interact, and make new friends on your journey!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Llamalandia is a cozy adventure game about finding your family and making a special bond with each llama you meet. Build your llama sanctuary to protect your family, raise the baby llamas so you can take them on your adventures, and invite other cute animals to live with you in this magical place.",
